{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33629","headline":"汴河十二韵 · 许棠","name":"汴河十二韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年开汴水，元应别有由。\n或兼通楚塞，宁独爲扬州。\n直断平芜色，横分积石流。\n所思千里便，岂计万方忧。\n首甚资功济，终难弭宴游。\n空怀龙舸下，不见锦帆收。\n浪倒长汀柳，风欹远岸楼。\n奔逾怀许竭，澄彻泗滨休。\n路要多行客，鱼稀少钓舟。\n日开天际晚，鴈合碛西秋。\n一派注沧海，几人生白头。\n常期身事毕，於此泳东浮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33629.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33629","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}